<title>GERMANY: Degussa to pay 13 mark 1995/96 dividend.</title>
<headline>Degussa to pay 13 mark 1995/96 dividend.</headline>
<text>
<p>FRANKFURT, Dec 19, Reuter - Year to September 30</p>
<p>    Dividend					   13  vs 12.50 marks</p>
<p>Dividend will be paid after annual meeting on February 14, 1997.</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Degussa AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
